t;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(sem assinatura paga)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=30;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="180" y="355" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-v5" value="&lt;b&gt;Ativa&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Active" style="rounded=1;arcSize=30;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="355" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-v6" value="&lt;b&gt;Atrasada&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PastDue" style="rounded=1;arcSize=30;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="355" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-v7" value="&lt;b&gt;Suspensa&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Suspended" style="rounded=1;arcSize=30;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="355" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-v8" value="&lt;b&gt;Cancelada&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Canceled" style="rounded=1;arcSize=30;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="655" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v3" target="estados-assinatura-v4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e10" value="pagamento&lt;br&gt;confirmado" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.35;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.35;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v4" target="estados-assinatura-v5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e11" value="renovação paga: avança o período&lt;br&gt;e aplica o plano menor agendado" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.3;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.7;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v5" target="estados-assinatura-v5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="600" y="270"/><mxPoint x="680" y="270"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e12" value="cobrança recusada&lt;br&gt;ou assinatura pausada" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.35;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.35;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v5" target="estados-assinatura-v6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e13" value="cobrança aprovada" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v6" target="estados-assinatura-v5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e14" value="7 dias&lt;br&gt;sem pagar" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.35;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.35;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v6" target="estados-assinatura-v7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e15" value="cobrança aprovada, ou assinou de novo e pagou" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.92;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v7" target="estados-assinatura-v5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1420" y="190"/><mxPoint x="724" y="190"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e16" value="lojista cancela&lt;br&gt;(no Vitrio ou no MP)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v5" target="estados-assinatura-v8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-70" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e17" value="lojista cancela" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v6" target="estados-assinatura-v8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1040" y="690"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e18" value="upgrade pago" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.75;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v8" target="estados-assinatura-v5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="50" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-e19" value="acabou o período pago" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="estados-assinatura-v8" target="estados-assinatura-v4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="280" y="690"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-v20" value="&lt;b&gt;Plano que vale&lt;/b&gt; (GetEffectivePlanAsync)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ativa, Atrasada ou Trial&lt;/b&gt;: o plano assinado&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cancelada&lt;/b&gt;: o plano assinado até CurrentPeriodEnd; depois, o Grátis&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Suspensa&lt;/b&gt; ou sem assinatura: o Grátis&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trial&lt;/b&gt; existe no enum, mas ainda não é usado." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="600" width="420" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-v21" value="&lt;b&gt;Checkout pendente&lt;/b&gt; não é um status: enquanto o lojista paga, a assinatura guarda PendingPlanId, PendingGatewaySubscriptionId e PendingSince. O plano só muda quando o Mercado Pago confirma." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="820" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-v22" value="&lt;b&gt;Admin&lt;/b&gt; pode pôr qualquer lojista em &lt;b&gt;Ativa&lt;/b&gt; com um plano sem cobrança (cancela a cobrança no Mercado Pago antes). Esse plano vale até o Admin mudar de novo." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="820" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="estados-assinatura-v23" value="&lt;b&gt;Atrasada&lt;/b&gt; só volta para Ativa com uma cobrança aprovada: o status “authorized” do Mercado Pago não prova que a última cobrança foi paga." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="820" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="f-automaticas" name="12. Tarefas automáticas"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v1" value="&lt;b&gt;Tarefas automáticas (BackgroundServices)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="1400" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v2" value="O que a API faz sozinha enquanto está no ar." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="50" width="1400" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v3" value="&lt;b&gt;SubscriptionMaintenanceService&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="100" width="400" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v4" value="API no ar (começa&lt;br&gt;1 min depois de subir)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="195" y="140" width="210" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v5" value="Rodada múltipla&lt;br&gt;de 30?&lt;br&gt;(a cada 30 min)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="250" width="180" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v6" value="Confere os checkouts&lt;br&gt;abertos nas últimas 2h" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="485" y="280" width="210" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v7" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Manutenção completa&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Suspende as atrasadas há mais de 7 dias&lt;br&gt;2. Aplica os planos menores agendados&lt;br&gt;3. Confere checkouts pendentes; descarta os&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;de mais de 2 dias (cancelando no MP)&lt;br&gt;4. Tenta de novo cancelar assinaturas&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;antigas de upgrades&lt;br&gt;5. Reconfere as pagas não conferidas há 6h&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="435" width="300" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v8" value="Espera 1 minuto" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="655" width="180" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-e9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#222222;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f-automaticas-v4" target="f-automaticas-v5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-e10" value="Não" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#222222;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f-automaticas-v5" target="f-automaticas-v6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-e11" value="Sim" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#222222;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f-automaticas-v5" target="f-automaticas-v7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-e12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#222222;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f-automaticas-v7" target="f-automaticas-v8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-e13" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#222222;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f-automaticas-v6" target="f-automaticas-v8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="590" y="680"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-e14" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#222222;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f-automaticas-v8" target="f-automaticas-v5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="120" y="680"/><mxPoint x="120" y="310"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v15" value="&lt;b&gt;CleanupService&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="100" width="400" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v16" value="2 min depois de subir,&lt;br&gt;depois a cada 6h" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="835" y="140" width="210" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v17" value="Banco: apaga links de senha e&lt;br&gt;sessões vencidos e webhooks&lt;br&gt;com mais de 90 dias" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="262" width="240" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v18" value="Cloudinary configurado&lt;br&gt;e modo diferente&lt;br&gt;de Off?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="390" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v19" value="Pula as imagens" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1135" y="425" width="170" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v20" value="Lista as imagens da pasta e&lt;br&gt;procura cada uma nas URLs&lt;br&gt;do banco" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="562" width="240" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f-automaticas-v21" value="Modo?" style="rh